sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst
    participant FB as FilterBar<br/>(webview)
    participant PMC as createPostMessageLLMClient<br/>(webview)
    participant CO as CatalogOverviewPanel<br/>(extension host)
    participant Proxy as LlmProxy<br/>(extension host)
    participant Sec as SecretStorage
    participant PC as providerCall<br/>(shared core)
    participant API as Anthropic<br/>Messages API

    Note over Analyst,API: Happy path — analyst submits a phrase

    Analyst->>FB: Type "UK submarines", press Enter
    FB->>FB: Abort prior in-flight (supersession)
    FB->>PMC: generate(prompt)
    PMC->>PMC: new requestId = uuid()
    PMC->>CO: postMessage { type:nlGenerate, requestId, prompt }
    CO->>Proxy: handleGenerate({requestId, prompt})

    alt Key cache miss
        Proxy->>Sec: get(nlSearch.anthropicApiKey)
        Sec-->>Proxy: apiKey
    end

    Proxy->>PC: providerCall({prompt, apiKey, signal, ...})
    PC->>API: POST /v1/messages
    API-->>PC: 200 OK {content:[{type:text, text:…}]}
    PC-->>Proxy: LiveOutcome{kind:success, rawResponse, ...}
    Proxy->>Proxy: delete requestId from controller map
    Proxy->>Proxy: emit [nl-search/live] log (no prompt, no response)
    Proxy-->>CO: LiveOutcome
    CO->>FB: postMessage { type:nlOutcome, requestId, outcome }
    FB->>PMC: handler(nlOutcome)
    PMC->>FB: resolve pending generate(prompt)
    FB->>FB: parseResponse → lozenges → dispatch chips
    FB->>Analyst: Chip bar + filtered map/list update

    Note over Analyst,API: Abort path — analyst submits a new phrase mid-call

    Analyst->>FB: Type "French frigates", press Enter
    FB->>PMC: abort()
    PMC->>CO: postMessage { type:nlAbort, requestId:PREVIOUS }
    CO->>Proxy: handleAbort({requestId})
    Proxy->>PC: signal.abort()
    PC->>API: req.destroy() (socket close)
    PC-->>Proxy: LiveOutcome{kind:transport-error, reason:cancelled}
    Proxy-->>CO: LiveOutcome
    CO->>FB: postMessage { type:nlOutcome, requestId:PREVIOUS, outcome:cancelled }
    FB->>FB: Drop silently (cancellation)
    FB->>PMC: generate(NEW prompt) — proceeds as happy path

    Note over Analyst,API: Never-reaches-network paths

    alt Feature disabled
        Proxy-->>Proxy: not-configured{reason:disabled}
    end
    alt Feature enabled but no key
        Proxy-->>Proxy: not-configured{reason:no-key}
    end
    alt Per-session ceiling hit
        Proxy-->>Proxy: ceiling-reached{ceiling:50}
    end
    Note right of Proxy: All three outcomes skip providerCall entirely —<br/>the analyst's budget is spent only on real<br/>in-flight provider calls.
